"entity": {
"name": "Lineage, Inc.",
"description": "Lineage, Inc. engages in the provision of temperature-controlled warehouse services as a real estate investment trust (REIT). It operates through the Global Warehousing and Global Integrated Solutions segments. The Global Warehousing segment consists of industrial real estate properties to provide temperature-controlled warehousing services to its customers. The Global Integrated Solutions segment offers supply chain services to facilitate the movement of products through the food supply chain to generate cost savings. The company was founded by Adam Forste and Kevin Marchetti in 2008 and is headquartered in Novi, MI.",
